title: Erzberger is murdered!
subtitle: The man who signed the armistice is shot in the Black Forest.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month >= 8 and month <= 9 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and e21_jena_done = 1
